ProtocolFeeCollector::setManualSwapReceiver
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when new manual swap receiver is zero address
    │   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorZeroAddress
    ├── when new manual swap receiver equals the current receiver
    │   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorNoStateChange
    └── when new manual swap receiver is valid and different
        ├── it should update manualSwapReceiver
        └── it should emit ManualSwapReceiverUpdated
